  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice spring onion.\n• Grate carrot.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369de4f7d5496ac4a64c26/step-5bfb6d00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369de4f7d5496ac4a64c26/step-25762110.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, boil the kettle.\n• In a medium microwave-safe bowl, whisk together Japanese curry paste, the boiling water (1/4 cup for 2 people / 1/2 cup for 4 people) and brown sugar, until smooth. Add the butter and microwave until melted and combined, 30 seconds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369de4f7d5496ac4a64c26/step-ff3d3c20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine carrot, shredded cabbage mix and a drizzle of vinegar.\n• Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369de4f7d5496ac4a64c26/step-948e6e30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Microwave mini flour tortillas on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second bursts until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369de4f7d5496ac4a64c26/step-51c3a040.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop plant-based chicken.\n• Fill tacos with creamy slaw and Japanese plant-based crumbed chick'n.\n• Spoon over katsu sauce. Top with spring onion to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369de4f7d5496ac4a64c26/step-d14d1150.jpg"
    }
  ]
